  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 6 × 3 + 8 ÷ 2 + 21 + 5 × 4 – 14 ÷ 7 = 53\n\nOption 1) 8 and 4\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 6 × 3 + **__4 ÷ 2__** + 21 + 5 × 8 – __**14 ÷ 7**__ = 53\n\n⇒ __**6 × 3**__ + 2 + 21 + **__5 × 8__** – 2 = 53\n\n⇒ **__18 + 2 + 21 + 40__** – 2 = 53\n\n⇒ **__81 – 2__** = 53\n\n⇒ 79 ≠ 53\n\nOption 2) 3 and 5\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 6 × 5 + __**8 ÷ 2**__ + 21 + 3 × 4 – __**14 ÷ 7**__ = 53\n\n⇒ __**6 × 5**__ + 4 + 21 + __**3 × 4**__ – 2 = 53\n\n⇒ __**30 + 4 + 21 + 12**__ – 2 = 53\n\n⇒ __**67 – 2**__ = 53\n\n⇒ 65 ≠ 53\n\nOption 3) 2 and 4\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 6 × 3 + __**8 ÷ 4**__ + 21 + 5 × 2 – __**14 ÷ 7**__ = 53\n\n⇒ __**6 × 3**__ + 2 + 21 + **__5 × 2__** – 2 = 53\n\n⇒ __**2 + 2 + 21 + 10**__ – 2 = 53\n\n⇒ __**35 – 2**__ = 53\n\n⇒ 33 ≠ 53\n\n**Option 4) 21 and 14**\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 6 × 3 + __**8 ÷ 2**__ + 14 + 5 × 4 – __**21 ÷ 7**__ = 53\n\n⇒ __**6 × 3**__ + 4 + 14 + __**5 × 4**__ – 3 = 53\n\n⇒ __**18 + 4 + 14 + 20**__ – 3 = 53\n\n⇒ __**56 – 3**__ = 53\n\n⇒ **53 = 53**\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"21 and 14\".**",
